<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets 750 mln guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets 750 mln guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    07.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.897   PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.222    SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND DSL DUE SEPT 2007.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
